/* module.c - module lifetime: initialisation, finalisation, and the
 * hardware bring-up that was previously done at the top level of the
 * BASIC program (buffer allocation, GPIO/SPI register mapping, and
 * PROCinitGPIO).
 *
 * The module keeps a single, static workspace instance (spiscreen_ws) -
 * this mirrors the original program's single set of global variables and
 * keeps things simple, since the hardware this module drives is a single
 * physical SPI LCD; the module is not designed to be multiply
 * instantiated.
 */

